# Words sent, then the list scrolled up a little while the agent works: its answer and its line coming and going
# under what is read, which stays where it shows (docs/list-motion.md: the row read from does not move).
timeout 20000
until 发消息
wait 600
tap 发消息
wait 500
type 看一下列表的高度
wait 700
tap icon:arrow-up
wait 1200
drag 195 300 0 160 400
wait 4500
